# Version pins for the toolchain (feat-5-foundation-monorepo-ci, REQ-003).
#
# This is the one source of truth for the versions of the tools. The install
# scripts (.specmgr/feat/feat-5-foundation-monorepo-ci/bin/) read it. The CI
# workflow repeats the versions as inputs of the setup actions, and a `just`
# recipe checks that both are the same (ACC-013).
#
# Format: KEY=value, no spaces, no quotes. A shell can source this file.
#
# Checksums: the values are copied from the files that the vendors publish
# (Temurin: the API of Adoptium; Maven: the .sha512 file; Node: SHASUMS256.txt;
# pnpm: the digest of the GitHub release; just: SHA256SUMS; npm and Maven Central:
# the checksum of the release). The Python tools have no checksum in this file: their
# lock files in tools/python/ have them. A change of a version must change the
# checksum, or the lock file, in the same commit. CODEOWNERS covers this file.
#
# What is checked with a checksum, and what is not (finding G2 of the review):
#
#   Install scripts (machine of the author): the JDK, Maven, Node, pnpm and just
#   are compared with the checksum of the download (JDK_SHA256, MAVEN_SHA512,
#   NODE_SHA256, PNPM_SHA256, JUST_SHA256).
#
#   The tools that the gates start in CI and on the machine of the author are
#   checked at run time:
#     - The Python tools (specmgr, PyYAML, license-expression with boolean.py;
#       feat-22-python-tools-lockfile): CHECKED, with all their dependencies. The lock
#       files in tools/python/ have the exact version and the sha256 of each file of each
#       package (44 packages for specmgr, 1 for PyYAML, 2 for license-expression). The gate
#       scripts install them with `uv pip install --require-hashes --only-binary :all:` in
#       a virtual environment of PYTHON_VERSION, so uv stops for a wrong hash, for a package
#       with no hash and for a package that is not in the file. No source archive is built.
#       This file has the version of each tool only (SPECMGR_VERSION, PYYAML_VERSION,
#       LICENSE_EXPRESSION_VERSION) and no checksum of them. `just check-pins` compares the
#       lock files with these versions (the procedure to change a version is in
#       tools/python/README.md).
#     - @cyclonedx/cdxgen (feat-16-cdxgen-lockfile): CHECKED, with all its
#       dependencies. tools/sbom/ is a pnpm project with one dependency and a
#       lock file that has an integrity value for each package (199 packages for
#       12.9.0, and 187 are installed on linux-x64). sbom.sh installs it with `pnpm install
#       --frozen-lockfile --ignore-scripts`, and pnpm compares each tarball with
#       the lock file. `just check-pins` compares package.json and the lock file
#       with CDXGEN_VERSION and CDXGEN_INTEGRITY of this file, so a change of only
#       one of the three places stops the check (the procedure to change the
#       version is in tools/sbom/README.md). Limit: a wrong integrity value of an
#       OPTIONAL dependency does not stop the install. pnpm does not install that
#       package, and the package does not run.
#     - @stoplight/spectral-cli (feat-6-contracts-openapi-pipeline, the OpenAPI linter): CHECKED, with all its
#       dependencies, as cdxgen. tools/spectral/ is a pnpm project with one dependency and a lock file that has
#       an integrity value for each package (242 packages). The gate script tools/gates/lint.sh installs it with
#       `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile --ignore-scripts`. `just check-pins` compares package.json and the lock
#       file with SPECTRAL_VERSION and SPECTRAL_INTEGRITY of this file (the procedure to change the version is
#       in tools/spectral/README.md). Spectral does not go to users (rule A), so its tree is not in the SBOM.
#     - oasdiff (feat-6-contracts-openapi-pipeline, Task 115.100, the tool for breaking changes of the OpenAPI
#       file): CHECKED, the download only. oasdiff is a Go binary with no dependency and no package manager.
#       tools/gates/breaking-changes.sh downloads the release file oasdiff_<OASDIFF_VERSION>_linux_amd64.tar.gz
#       from GitHub, compares its sha256 with OASDIFF_SHA256 before it unpacks the file, and puts the binary in
#       build/tools/ (the folder is not in git). The gates run on Linux x86_64 only (a runner of GitHub, and the
#       machine of the author, as the install scripts for just and Node), so there is one checksum, and the
#       script stops on another platform. `just check-pins` compares OASDIFF_VERSION and OASDIFF_SHA256 with the
#       file tools/breaking/oasdiff-checksums.txt, which is the file `checksums.txt` of the release (the
#       procedure to change the version is in tools/breaking/README.md), so a change of only one place stops the
#       check.
#     - cyclonedx-maven-plugin: sbom.sh compares the sha256 of the jar in the local
#       repository with CYCLONEDX_MAVEN_PLUGIN_SHA256 before the plugin makes the
#       SBOM. The dependencies of the plugin are not checked (GitHub issue #23).
#     - openapi-generator-maven-plugin (feat-6-contracts-openapi-pipeline, Task 120.105): the same way. The
#       gates `just generate`, `just compile` and `just api-docs` compare the sha256 of the jar in the local
#       repository with OPENAPI_GENERATOR_MAVEN_PLUGIN_SHA256 before they start the plugin, and `just check-pins`
#       compares OPENAPI_GENERATOR_MAVEN_PLUGIN_VERSION with the version in backend/pom.xml. The dependencies of the
#       plugin are not checked (GitHub issue #23, the issue stays open for a full pinning).
#     - Kubb, Zod and TypeScript (feat-6-contracts-openapi-pipeline, Task 120.110): CHECKED, with all their
#       dependencies. frontend/ is a pnpm module with a lock file that has an integrity value for each package
#       (102 packages). The gates install it with `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile --ignore-scripts`. `just check-pins`
#       compares frontend/package.json and the lock file with the keys KUBB_*, ZOD_* and TYPESCRIPT_* of this file.
#     - uv itself, the Python build that uv downloads and the GitHub Actions: UV_VERSION
#       has no checksum (the action astral-sh/setup-uv downloads it), and the actions
#       are pinned to a commit SHA.
#
# JDK: Eclipse Temurin 21 (LTS), GPL-2.0-only WITH Classpath-exception-2.0
JDK_VERSION=21.0.13+9
JDK_SHA256=d7f5d5cf865a2902b70ff549b97586a7d3f234e016f041ab447ea740c7d66d1c

# Maven (the 3.x line; Maven 4 is a release candidate), Apache-2.0
MAVEN_VERSION=3.10.0
MAVEN_SHA512=908b1501bfb420bf7c8affb855534a9c407fd6099367bfb9f2f2dcb8e9799102bffb84518cde74c679bd76870247c6528683abdd620581bffa90f95d92d175aa

# Node 26 (LTS "Lithium"), MIT. This release has no corepack.
NODE_VERSION=26.13.0
NODE_SHA256=d28a96af6c38596f6d9d97c0ee531c13d238d757742387d1928de822d959e997

# pnpm (standalone release, no corepack), MIT
PNPM_VERSION=12.16.1
PNPM_SHA256=565ff81174a14f6f7bd5d84c1b17e51031a80230d370a1fe24be5d16bd02a825

# just, CC0-1.0
JUST_VERSION=1.59.0
JUST_SHA256=409044617b6f06517c1035e55ca38c8c856ff8b650e41bc2aa1ef82d5903a23e

# uv, MIT OR Apache-2.0. CI only (the action astral-sh/setup-uv). The machine
# of the author has its own uv, and no install script changes it.
UV_VERSION=0.13.7

# Python for the gates (feat-22-python-tools-lockfile), PSF-2.0 (the class Permitted since 2026-11-04).
# The minor version. The lock files in tools/python/ are valid for each 3.13 release. The gate scripts
# start `uv venv --python 3.13`, and uv downloads a managed Python if no 3.13 is on the machine.
PYTHON_VERSION=3.13

# SBOM tools (feat-5, Task 130.130)
# cyclonedx-maven-plugin, Apache-2.0 (the checksum is for the jar)
CYCLONEDX_MAVEN_PLUGIN_VERSION=2.9.3
CYCLONEDX_MAVEN_PLUGIN_SHA256=c452d5eebe28bc86bef2e7c72d129f04f60877bef843eac8120f01fb655be293
# @cyclonedx/cdxgen, Apache-2.0 (the integrity value of the npm package). The lock file
# tools/sbom/pnpm-lock.yaml and tools/sbom/package.json must have the same values
# (just check-pins checks it). Change all three places in one commit: tools/sbom/README.md.
CDXGEN_VERSION=12.9.0
CDXGEN_INTEGRITY=sha512-+LWBiyTgdSWdprdsA7xpNEhD9NV/Wo3TvqaVYQHjP3kEeNEZTV+08U8CYh+P2+2CHycwKFWHhtSREN+p/r6Sgw==

# @stoplight/spectral-cli, Apache-2.0 (the integrity value of the npm package; feat-6-contracts-openapi-pipeline,
# Task 110.110). The lock file tools/spectral/pnpm-lock.yaml and tools/spectral/package.json must have the same
# values (just check-pins checks it). Change all three places in one commit: tools/spectral/README.md.
SPECTRAL_VERSION=6.17.0
SPECTRAL_INTEGRITY=sha512-9OTHNYqfF99hjHsh5aCjNHRZgocJBaHa6uaQTBUOsgAA19jaLaT8xB6/SBGC+GA7Wpzu4t9MMIOXPLj0ZbL5UA==

# oasdiff, Apache-2.0 (feat-6-contracts-openapi-pipeline, Task 115.100). OASDIFF_SHA256 is the sha256 of the
# release file oasdiff_<OASDIFF_VERSION>_linux_amd64.tar.gz (the same value is in `checksums.txt` of the release and
# in the digest of GitHub). tools/breaking/oasdiff-checksums.txt must have the same value (just check-pins checks
# it). Change both places in one commit: tools/breaking/README.md.
OASDIFF_VERSION=1.35.0
OASDIFF_SHA256=a8023002fcb2eaa7f5758148a9303cb63d33b939886df312268bc0fc7b939140

# openapi-generator-maven-plugin, Apache-2.0 (feat-6-contracts-openapi-pipeline, Task 120.105). The checksum is for the
# jar of the plugin in the local Maven repository (~/.m2). The value is the sha256 that the agent computed from the jar of
# Maven Central (Maven Central has the .sha1 file, and no .sha256 file; the sha1 of the jar is the same as the .sha1 file).
# backend/pom.xml must have the same version (just check-pins checks it). tools/gates/_lib.sh (verify_generator_plugin)
# compares the jar with the checksum before `just generate`, `just compile` and `just api-docs` start the plugin. The
# dependencies of the plugin are NOT checked (GitHub issue #23, tools/gates/README.md). Change the version in
# this file and in backend/pom.xml, and the checksum, in one commit.
OPENAPI_GENERATOR_MAVEN_PLUGIN_VERSION=7.27.0
OPENAPI_GENERATOR_MAVEN_PLUGIN_SHA256=9af831e2593931d9fe91a0804cd550f6f040bc690ab96aaf503b20c7558fa1c6

# The pnpm module frontend/ (feat-6-contracts-openapi-pipeline, Task 120.110): the Zod generator Kubb (MIT), Zod (MIT) and
# TypeScript (Apache-2.0). Each value is the version and the integrity value of the npm package (the value of
# `dist.integrity` of the registry). frontend/package.json (exact versions, no range) and frontend/pnpm-lock.yaml must
# have the same values (just check-pins checks it: the importer of the lock file, and the integrity value of each of the
# six packages). Change all three places in one commit: frontend/README.md. @kubb/core has the version of `kubb`.
KUBB_VERSION=5.15.3
KUBB_INTEGRITY=sha512-g6pz/3ATDbKbO/rWLRf7S0WgHcHgWRpHHHgsaI4FxzIg0y6BxmxDJ/p/5H8S0Qmrf9IZQxt1jExAPliQ2f1q6A==
KUBB_CORE_INTEGRITY=sha512-4GT5thprHbvLYYRYq6cvAxq5NAb4KIPFus3CH6S7TzKGGTlDtWaaeD0D21kOIdQPAQPh2WlxNjbruBJcN5HaIA==
KUBB_PLUGIN_ZOD_VERSION=5.8.0
KUBB_PLUGIN_ZOD_INTEGRITY=sha512-9sss7WMm2N2EMUwOapNm3g/5dKsWXcM5+7QTqIw4Ak3tTDWfavGro9ePmPlhjPCKr9GOUz8fFWNba/7Wc41TnQ==
KUBB_PLUGIN_TS_VERSION=5.4.0
KUBB_PLUGIN_TS_INTEGRITY=sha512-1bXdrvsJ1NbcZRI0v9mtM2WX+JinMRjsVGbRMiAkq8zrahfDwzOVcZn3MjnBNUkjN0FxHJLlwo7pN0Wpq1K9Zw==
ZOD_VERSION=4.6.7
ZOD_INTEGRITY=sha512-g8W2D2kU6a8untc053fX1uVBKzM7yqAxW/3zwk83+6RyF2+SKOuV+c0wBDhUwzV1PaGapmZH+rmcUzPf+3CGwg==
TYPESCRIPT_VERSION=5.9.3
TYPESCRIPT_INTEGRITY=sha512-jl1vZzPDinLr9eUt3J/t7V6FgNEw9QjvBPdysz9KfQDD41fQrC2Y4vKQdiaUpFT4bXlb1RHhLpp8wtm6M5TgSw==

# Python tools of the gates (feat-5, Tasks 130.110 to 130.142; feat-22-python-tools-lockfile). These are
# the direct tools. Their dependencies and all checksums are in the lock files in tools/python/
# (just check-pins compares the version of each tool in its lock file with the version here).
# These tools do not go to users, so rule A applies (only the main license).
# license-expression, Apache-2.0 (the wheel has a data file under CC-BY-4.0). Its dependency
# boolean.py (BSD-2-Clause) is in tools/python/license-expression.lock.
LICENSE_EXPRESSION_VERSION=30.4.4
# specmgr (the PyPI package biz-dfch-specmgr), AGPL-3.0-or-later
SPECMGR_VERSION=0.38.0
# PyYAML, MIT (the gates for workflows read the YAML with it)
PYYAML_VERSION=6.0.3
